--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7e8140d05737a11468020c371c32ff33, type: 3}
  m_Name: Resolve_FK_P02_03
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: AQ.App::AQ.App.CaseGraph
  startId: FK_P02_03_N1
  stageBackground: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b61e15d0a1b2c3d4e5f6a7b8c9d0e105, type: 3}
  nodes:
  - id: FK_P02_03_N1
    speaker: "Ruby Walker"
    line: "It isn't any of you four, and I'd know. Someone with my key has been in my house, or I've started imagining things. I can't tell which, and both frighten me."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3eda8c3a8ba44593b8d95260ba6b7487, type: 3}
    emotion: 0
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    waitForAudio: 0
    requiresFlag: 
    skipIfFlagMissing: 1
    setsFlag: 
    nextId: FK_P02_03_N2
    choices: []
  - id: FK_P02_03_N2
    speaker: "Ruby Walker"
    line: "The first thing was the yard gate. I bolt it every night. One morning in October it was unbolted, and I couldn't swear I'd bolted it."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3eda8c3a8ba44593b8d95260ba6b7487, type: 3}
    emotion: 0
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    waitForAudio: 0
    requiresFlag: 
    skipIfFlagMissing: 1
    setsFlag: 
    nextId: FK_P02_03_N3
    choices: []
  - id: FK_P02_03_N3
    speaker: "Ruby Walker"
    line: "I changed the front door lock and told only you four where the new spare was. It happened again after that. So I took the key in, told nobody, and it stopped."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3eda8c3a8ba44593b8d95260ba6b7487, type: 3}
    emotion: 0
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    waitForAudio: 0
    requiresFlag: 
    skipIfFlagMissing: 1
    setsFlag: 
    nextId: FK_P02_03_N4
    choices: []
  - id: FK_P02_03_N4
    speaker: "Ruby Walker"
    line: "I don't think I'm going to die. I think I'm going to be sixty and embarrassed. If I'm wrong, nobody needs to know. If I'm right, you'll want to know what I noticed."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0daf7b4e2afb4baca0c6660666687b94, type: 3}
    emotion: 2
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    waitForAudio: 0
    requiresFlag: 
    skipIfFlagMissing: 1
    setsFlag: 
    nextId: FK_P02_03_N5
    choices: []
  - id: FK_P02_03_N5
    speaker: "Ally Quinn"
    line: "Here Ruby's hand goes over the page. The lines about Violet's mother. She picks up again below her hand."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 792b5f88f6dd2724d84b6954cc0b5fad, type: 3}
    emotion: 0
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    waitForAudio: 0
    requiresFlag: 
    skipIfFlagMissing: 1
    setsFlag: 
    nextId: FK_P02_03_N6
    choices: []
  - id: FK_P02_03_N6
    speaker: "Ruby Walker"
    line: "Somebody got the place of my spare from one of you without your knowing, or watched one of you use it. Write down everything odd you've noticed this year. About me, and about who has been near each of you."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3eda8c3a8ba44593b8d95260ba6b7487, type: 3}
    emotion: 0
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    waitForAudio: 0
    requiresFlag: 
    skipIfFlagMissing: 1
    setsFlag: 
    nextId: FK_P02_03_N7
    choices: []
  - id: FK_P02_03_N7
    speaker: "Ruby Walker"
    line: "Read the four lists together at one table. Since I'm asking you to, here's mine. Liam has owned a third of the yard for eight years and lets the town think he's staff."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3eda8c3a8ba44593b8d95260ba6b7487, type: 3}
    emotion: 0
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    waitForAudio: 0
    requiresFlag: 
    skipIfFlagMissing: 1
    setsFlag: 
    nextId: FK_P02_03_N8
    choices: []
  - id: FK_P02_03_N8
    speaker: "Ally Quinn"
    line: "Her hand goes down again. One line. She won't read that one either."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 792b5f88f6dd2724d84b6954cc0b5fad, type: 3}
    emotion: 0
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    waitForAudio: 0
    requiresFlag: 
    skipIfFlagMissing: 1
    setsFlag: 
    nextId: FK_P02_03_N9
    choices: []
  - id: FK_P02_03_N9
    speaker: "Ruby Walker"
    line: "Ruby's been on nights since August and won't say why. Margo hasn't been to the slip since summer. And Brad paid me back the van money this autumn, every penny. The one thing this year that went right."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3eda8c3a8ba44593b8d95260ba6b7487, type: 3}
    emotion: 0
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    waitForAudio: 0
    requiresFlag: 
    skipIfFlagMissing: 1
    setsFlag: 
    nextId: FK_P02_03_N10
    choices: []
  - id: FK_P02_03_N10
    speaker: "Ruby Walker"
    line: "Not the police. I've nothing they'd act on, and I won't have them in your lives over a gate and a feeling. You four can do what they won't. Read this together. Be careful. Write legibly. Violet."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0daf7b4e2afb4baca0c6660666687b94, type: 3}
    emotion: 2
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    waitForAudio: 0
    requiresFlag: 
    skipIfFlagMissing: 1
    setsFlag: 
    nextId: FK_P02_03_D
    choices: []
  - id: FK_P02_03_D
    speaker: "Ally Quinn"
    line: "What does the city hear next week?"
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e02460f0c092dde4891723eecbbdc368, type: 3}
    emotion: 5
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    waitForAudio: 0
    requiresFlag: 
    skipIfFlagMissing: 1
    setsFlag: 
    nextId: FK_P02_03_R1
    choices:
    - text: "Air Ruby's whole reading"
      nextId: FK_P02_03_R1
      requiresFlag: 
    - text: "Air only verified lines"
      nextId: FK_P02_03_R2
      requiresFlag: 
  - id: FK_P02_03_R1
    speaker: "Ally Quinn"
    line: "I'll air every line Ruby read. The words go out in Ruby's voice as much as Violet's, and Ruby carries them round Havenbay."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 792b5f88f6dd2724d84b6954cc0b5fad, type: 3}
    emotion: 0
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    waitForAudio: 0
    requiresFlag: 
    skipIfFlagMissing: 1
    setsFlag: aq.fk.d1.aired
    nextId: FK_P02_03_N11
    choices: []
  - id: FK_P02_03_R2
    speaker: "Ally Quinn"
    line: "I'll air only lines I can verify elsewhere. The city hears less, and what Ruby covered stays at her table."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 792b5f88f6dd2724d84b6954cc0b5fad, type: 3}
    emotion: 0
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    waitForAudio: 0
    requiresFlag: 
    skipIfFlagMissing: 1
    setsFlag: aq.fk.d1.held
    nextId: FK_P02_03_N11
    choices: []
  - id: FK_P02_03_N11
    speaker: "Ruby Walker"
    line: "If you cut what I read, people will think I cut it. The lines under my hand stay there either way."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4f3c2252e9b24f179e5e92bb42f0a6bb, type: 3}
    emotion: 5
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    waitForAudio: 0
    requiresFlag: 
    skipIfFlagMissing: 1
    setsFlag: 
    nextId: 
    choices: []
